<title>UK: Daimler-Benz results delayed.</title>
<headline>Daimler-Benz results delayed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of first-half results by German conglomerate Daimler-Benz AG has been delayed because reporters who were flying in from Germany have not arrived at the scheduled news conference, a reporter at the conference centre said.</p>
<p>The German reporters were still somewhere between the airport and the news conference at 0936 GMT.</p>
<p>The results were due out at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
